flowchart LR
    E[Organizer evaluator] -->|GET /answer| A[Contract adapter]
    A --> G[Input guard and log redaction]
    G --> PR{Pre-router: exact code/ISIN/ticker?}
    PR -->|yes, skip HCX| C
    PR -->|no| H[HyperCLOVA X Stage-1: concept-only plan]
    H --> GR[Grounder: concept to physical QueryPlan, fail-closed]
    GR --> S[Registry semantic validator]
    S --> C[Allow-listed compiler]
    C --> X{Single scope or cross scope?}
    X -->|single scope| D[(DuckDB)]
    X -->|cross scope| CS[Cross-scope executor: decompose into per-scope subplans]
    CS --> D
    D --> B[Evidence Bundle builder]
    B --> R[Template or grounded renderer]
    R --> V[Claim and safety validator]
    V --> A
    ER[Entity resolution: exact code, then KG alias, then LIKE, then BM25 fallback via RRF] --> C
    KG[(Knowledge Graph: nodes, edges, aliases)] --> ER
    LEX[(BM25 lexical index)] --> ER
    SEM[Semantic layer: concept catalog and comparability matrix] --> GR
    SEM --> CS
    M[Metric Registry] --> S
    M --> B
    L[Source locator] --> B
    F[Immutable release manifest] --> A
